Mr. Pitcher,

Attached is my response to your denial of October 15, 2026. It is also 
published at oprdvolunteerabuse.org.

The response asks for four things: a decision on the fee waiver that 
addresses the five facts stated in the request of September 23; a 
decision on a reduction under ORS 192.324(5); answers to the two 
questions I put to Ms. Gutridge on September 24; and a breakdown of the 
1,350 records by category and division.

The Public Records Advocate is copied. The dispute is before him under 
ORS 192.464.

*Robert Samuel White*
